---
/** Proof the Guild delivers (StoryBrand "guide": authority). */
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section tone="charcoal" labelledby="results-title" pad="tight">
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:items-center md:gap-12">
    <p class="font-serif text-[clamp(3.5rem,2.5rem+4vw,6rem)] leading-none text-brass-glow">8%</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="results-title" class="text-h3 md:text-[1.75rem]">
        Concrete Results at Saint Mary of Victories
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-[60ch] font-sans leading-relaxed text-stone/85">
        Since the Guild began serving the parish, its operating costs are down 8% year over year,
        with countless hours of discounted and pro bono labor.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
